</div>

</div>

</section>

<footer>

<h3>Outdoor Adventure Store</h3>

<p>
Jl. Petualang No. 88 • Indonesia
</p>

<p>
© 2026 Outdoor Adventure. All Rights Reserved.
</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
